  <Docs>
    <summary>
            Per-endpoint TLS configuration for an endpoint served by the DirectTls transport.
            </summary>
    <remarks>
            DirectTls is TLS-only: every endpoint served by this transport terminates TLS, so a server certificate
            (either <see cref="P:Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Transport.DirectTls.DirectTlsEndpointOptions.ServerCertificate" /> or <see cref="P:Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Transport.DirectTls.DirectTlsEndpointOptions.ServerCertificateSelector" />) is required.
            </remarks>
  </Docs>
